<title>CHINA: SGA sets call warrants on Hutchison.</title>
<headline>SGA sets call warrants on Hutchison.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV, SGA, said on Thursday it had launched 41 million American style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$70.25	 PREMIUM	 17.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.229	 GEARING	 5.71x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 24.JUL.97	PAYDATE	 12.AUG.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  24.JUL.98	LISTING DATE  13.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	BOARD LOT     10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$70.25</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR STOCK DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>CHOICE</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
